-11-21T00:00:00Z","speed":1}],"beats":[{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:00Z","text":"Zelensky says Crimean Bridge strikes 'fair response' as he meets UK's Streeting, BBC News reports.","cites":["news:bbc:f6fc1dbe4ebe"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:08Z","text":"On 16 November 2026, Ukrainian drones struck the Crimean Bridge at 5:38 EET, shifting one of its two structural arches, forcing the partial closure of road traffic over the bridge.","cites":["wiki:rev:1386814290:69"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:16Z","text":"The Crimean Bridge, also called Kerch Strait Bridge or Kerch Bridge, is a double road and rail bridge spanning the Kerch Strait between the Taman Peninsula of Krasnodar Krai in Russia and the Kerch Peninsula of Crimea.","cites":["wiki:rev:1386814290:0"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:24Z","text":"16 November: The Crimean Bridge is struck by a Ukrainian kamikaze drone, damaging the structure and prompting Russian authorities to close vehicle traffic.","cites":["wiki:2026-11-16:2"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:35Z","text":"18 November: The Crimean Bridge is struck by Ukrainian forces for the third time in four days, prompting Russian authorities to close the bridge to all traffic.","cites":["wiki:2026-11-18:1"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:54Z","text":"Cold gives way to rain in parts of UK as weather warning issued for south-west England, The Guardian reports.","cites":["news:guardian:cac520db6f0d"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:01Z","text":"Princess of Wales speaks about impact of cancer diagnosis in BBC film Heal, The Guardian reports.","cites":["news:guardian:d91368aed15e"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:08Z","text":"Newcastle United vs Arsenal LIVE: Premier League, Al Jazeera reports.","cites":["news:aljazeera:c4dd41a20daa"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:15Z","text":"Chaudhary helps Australia beat England in T20 shake-off of scandal-hit run, Al Jazeera reports.","cites":["news:aljazeera:7db697fc07f3"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:22Z","text":"Location: Russia, Ukraine. Founded: 2015.","cites":["wd:Q2652980:P276","